{
    "title": "Deferit: Pay bills in 4",
    "description": "Budget and pay any bill with no interest or late fees. Simply upload a bill, choose how much to pay, and we pay it for you. You pay over time in 4 simple installments!\r\n\r\nMove payments and stay on top of your bills all from within the app.\r\n\r\nSplit bills in 4:\r\n- Simply take a photo, screenshot or add a file.\r\n- Select the amount to pay your biller.\r\n- We pay them the full amount upfront\r\n- You pay back over time in installments!\r\n\r\nSave money on your bills:\r\n- Pay less for the same service across internet, phone, TV and more.\r\n- Our team of account experts negotiate with your biller.\r\n- If we can't save you money you don't pay anything.\r\n\r\nBuild your credit history with any bill payment:\r\n- Most bill payments go unreported, we've changed that.\r\n- Pay any bill as you normally would through the Deferit app.\r\n- We report the payment to the three major credit bureaus.\r\n- Building credit history can attract lower rates on loans and more.\r\n\r\nGet started today and join a community of over 500,000 Americans using Deferit to take power over their bills.\r\n\r\nThe Deferit \u201cSplit bills in 4\u201d feature is available in select states. We will inform you, based on your address, whether the \u201cSplit bills in 4\u201d option is available to you upon onboarding. Split bills in 4 is subject to eligibility and a down payment may be required. The Credit Builder feature, Bill Savings and our bill management platform are available in all states.\r\n\r\nDeferit charges a monthly membership fee of $14.99. No lock-ins. All payments are subject to a processing fee of $0.99.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Budget and pay any bill with no interest or late fees. Simply upload a bill, choose how much to pay, and we pay it for you. You pay over time in 4 simple installments!<br><br>Move payments and stay on top of your bills all from within the app.<br><br>Split bills in 4:<br>- Simply take a photo, screenshot or add a file.<br>- Select the amount to pay your biller.<br>- We pay them the full amount upfront<br>- You pay back over time in installments!<br><br>Save money on your bills:<br>- Pay less for the same service across internet, phone, TV and more.<br>- Our team of account experts negotiate with your biller.<br>- If we can&#39;t save you money you don&#39;t pay anything.<br><br>Build your credit history with any bill payment:<br>- Most bill payments go unreported, we&#39;ve changed that.<br>- Pay any bill as you normally would through the Deferit app.<br>- We report the payment to the three major credit bureaus.<br>- Building credit history can attract lower rates on loans and more.<br><br>Get started today and join a community of over 500,000 Americans using Deferit to take power over their bills.<br><br>The Deferit \u201cSplit bills in 4\u201d feature is available in select states. We will inform you, based on your address, whether the \u201cSplit bills in 4\u201d option is available to you upon onboarding. Split bills in 4 is subject to eligibility and a down payment may be required. The Credit Builder feature, Bill Savings and our bill management platform are available in all states.<br><br>Deferit charges a monthly membership fee of $14.99. No lock-ins. All payments are subject to a processing fee of $0.99.",
